egin a new journey! Meanwhile, Tama Youko continues her search for the nine-tailed fox who now has the power to destroy the world: Jinka.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite, edited)"},"tags":[{"name":"Youkai","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":70,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shounen","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dragons","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Samurai","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cultivation","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kemonomimi","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Found Family","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Sengoku Youko: The Thousandfold Chaos Arc","english":"Sengoku Youko: The Thousandfold Chaos Arc","native":"戦国妖狐 千魔混沌編","romaji":"Sengoku Youko: Senma Konton-hen","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"战国妖狐 千魔混沌篇"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Sengoku Youko: Sen Ma Konton Hen"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Sengoku Youko (2024)"}]},"trailer":{"id":"3FrczvAlrpk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3FrczvAlrpk/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}